<title>ISRAEL: Christopher meets Levy on Israel-PLO talks.</title>
<headline>Christopher meets Levy on Israel-PLO talks.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher began a meeting with Israeli Foreign Minister David Levy in Jerusalem on Monday, the second day of intensive peace talks between Israelis and Palestinians, officials said.</p>
<p>The two sides were to resume the U.S.-mediated negotiations at 4 p.m. (1400 GMT) in efforts to achieve a long-delayed Israeli troop redeployment from the West Bank town of Hebron.</p>
</text>
